1
00:00:00,274 --> 00:00:02,024
(Leonard:)Don't tell Koothrappali.

2
00:00:02,943 --> 00:00:04,903
(Leonard:)-After you.
PENNY: Oh. What a gentleman.

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,360
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.

4
00:00:06,572 --> 00:00:07,702
[YELLS]

5
00:00:07,865 --> 00:00:09,615
LEONARD:
Oh, my God, are you--? Whoa!

6
00:00:10,743 --> 00:00:13,073
(Sheldon:)Good Lord! You're ruining everything!

7
00:00:13,245 --> 00:00:15,165
(Penny:)-Oh, damn.
-Are you okay?

8
00:00:15,331 --> 00:00:16,751
(Penny:)Do I look okay?

9
00:00:16,915 --> 00:00:18,795
(Leonard:)Don't bark at me. I fell too.

10
00:00:18,959 --> 00:00:21,919
(Penny:)You've been falling all night.
You're used to it.

11
00:00:22,755 --> 00:00:24,465
Sheldon, what are you doing?

12
00:00:24,631 --> 00:00:26,341
(Sheldon:)The same thing I've been doing.

13
00:00:26,508 --> 00:00:29,598
(Sheldon:)Trying to figure out why electrons
have no mass...

14
00:00:29,762 --> 00:00:32,552
-...when traveling through graphene.
-With marbles?

15
00:00:32,765 --> 00:00:36,015
(Sheldon:)I needed something bigger
than peas, now, didn't I?

16
00:00:36,685 --> 00:00:39,645
(Bernadette:)Sheldon, when was the last time
you got any sleep?

17
00:00:39,813 --> 00:00:40,853
(Sheldon:)Two, three days.

18
00:00:41,023 --> 00:00:44,113
(Sheldon:)Not important. I don't need sleep.
I need answers.

19
00:00:44,276 --> 00:00:48,776
(Sheldon:)I need to determine where
in this swamp of unbalanced formulas...

20
00:00:48,947 --> 00:00:51,617
...squateth the toad of truth.

21
00:00:52,785 --> 00:00:55,745
The toad of truth?
Is that a physics thing?

22
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:58,663
(Leonard:)No. That's a crazy thing.

